      "rationale": "convention:base-class-init-into-builtins. The raised class is a project subclass of Exception with no __init__ of its own, so constructing it runs the inherited builtin BaseException/Exception initializer. PyCG does not record base-class initializers that live in builtins. Classes: api.APIError, config.ConfigError, asciicast.LoadError, v1/v2.LoadError, http_adapter.HTTPConnectionError (all 'class X(Exception): pass').",
